B.a3U=new A.a2(B.a6M,["Her 1 Oyun Y\u0131l\u0131 (240 Saniye)","2.0x Odun \xdcretimi (\u015eato Geli\u015ftirme)","-%25 Karo Fetih Maliyeti (G\xf6\xe7 Sonras\u0131)","1.8x Demir \xdcretimi (\u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi)","+%50 \u0130\u015f\xe7i & Kervan H\u0131z\u0131"],t.w)
B.a1w=s(["Ekran\u0131n \xfcst bar\u0131ndaki G\xf6ksel Rozete bakarak o an hangi hayvan y\u0131l\u0131nda oldu\u011funuzu kontrol edin.","Gelen hayvan l\xfctfuna g\xf6re \xfcretimi koordine edin (\xd6rn: Pars y\u0131l\u0131nda odun, Ejder y\u0131l\u0131nda demir \xfcretimi).","Tav\u015fan Y\u0131l\u0131 geldi\u011finde yeni karolar\u0131 fetheterek haritan\u0131z\u0131 asgari maliyetle geni\u015fletin."],t.s)
B.Yt=s(["Check the active celestial omen badge on the top HUD to view the current animal year.","Coordinate production around the active blessing (e.g., wood in Tiger year, iron in Dragon year).","Conquer frontier hexes during the Hare Year for maximum resource efficiency."],t.s)
B.Zy=s(["G\xd6KSEL G\xd6\xc7 TAKT\u0130\u011e\u0130: B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7\xfc Tav\u015fan Y\u0131l\u0131na denk getirdi\u011finizde yeni diyarda 12 karoyu sadece 2-3 dakikada fethedersiniz.","Pars Y\u0131l\u0131nda harcad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z odun miktar\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131s\u0131p Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bir sonraki seviyeye y\xfckseltin.","Ejder Y\u0131l\u0131nda d\xf6k\xfclen \u015eam \xc7elikleri ile K\xfclt\xfcrel Zafer \u015fartlar\u0131n\u0131 h\u0131zla tamamlay\u0131n."],t.s)
B.a2b=s(["CELESTIAL MIGRATION TACTIC: Time migrations with the Hare Year to conquer 12 hexes in 2-3 minutes at 25% discount.","Save wood during Tiger Year to fuel consecutive Castle upgrades.","Maximize Damascus Steel smelting during Dragon Year to rush Cultural Victory requirements."],t.s)
