B.Tf=new A.bw("seasons_celestial_omens",B.pP,"12 Hayvanl\u0131 G\xf6ksel Takvim & Kehanet Sinerjisi","12-Year Celestial Calendar & Omen Synergy","Her yeni y\u0131lda g\xf6klerden inen 12 kadim hayvan ruhunun k\xfcresel l\xfctuflar\u0131 ve g\xf6\xe7 koordinasyonu.","Each game year bestows a global omen from the 12 celestial animal spirits with tactical migration synergies.","Her 4 mevsim tamamland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (240 saniye) yeni bir G\xf6ksel Y\u0131l ba\u015flar ve t\xfcm ka\u011fanl\u0131\u011fa devasa k\xfcresel \xe7arpanlar iner:\n\n\u2022 Pars Y\u0131l\u0131 (Kereste & \u0130n\u015faat): Ormanlar co\u015far, kereste \xfcretimi 2 kat\u0131na (2.0x) \xe7\u0131kar. \u015eato y\xfckseltmeleri ve k\u0131\u015fl\u0131k yak\u0131t ambar\u0131 bu y\u0131lda doldurulmal\u0131d\u0131r.\n\u2022 Tav\u015fan Y\u0131l\u0131 (G\xf6\xe7 & Fetih): Fetih ve geni\u015fleme maliyetleri %25 ucuzlar. B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7\xfcn hemen ard\u0131ndan Tav\u015fan Y\u0131l\u0131nda harita rekor h\u0131zla fethedilir.\n\u2022 Ejder Y\u0131l\u0131 (Maden & Metalurji): Madenler zengin filiz d\xf6ker (1.8x Demir). \u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi d\xf6k\xfcmhaneleri bu y\u0131lda tam kapasite \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmal\u0131d\u0131r.\n\u2022 At Y\u0131l\u0131 (Lojistik & Kervan): \u0130\u015f\xe7iler ve kervanlar %50 daha h\u0131zl\u0131 ko\u015far. Fabrika ve ambar aras\u0131ndaki t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131klar an\u0131nda erir.\n\u2022 S\u0131\xe7an Y\u0131l\u0131 (Refah & Ambar): Tah\u0131l \xfcretimi 1.4x katlan\u0131r, ambar kapasitesi geni\u015fler.\n\u2022 S\u0131\u011f\u0131r Y\u0131l\u0131 (K\u0131\u015f Direnci): Zud f\u0131rt\u0131nalar\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 do\u011fal kalkan sa\u011flar, ta\u015f ocaklar\u0131 co\u015far.\n\u2022 Koyun Y\u0131l\u0131 (Bozk\u0131r S\xfcr\xfcs\xfc): S\xfcr\xfc bereketi +%60 k\u0131m\u0131z ve ia\u015fe sa\u011flar, bilgelik \xfcretimi h\u0131zlan\u0131r.\n\u2022 Y\u0131lan Y\u0131l\u0131 (Kadim Simya): \u015eifac\u0131lar iksir \xfcretir, pazar takas kurlar\u0131 en y\xfcksek seviyeye ula\u015f\u0131r.","Every completed 4-season cycle (240s) ushers in a new Celestial Year offering huge global multipliers:\n\n\u2022 Tiger Year: Wood production doubles (2.0x). Stockpile wood for Castle upgrades and winter warmth.\n\u2022 Hare Year: Conquest costs drop by 25%. Ideal for rapid early expansion right after a Great Migration.\n\u2022 Dragon Year: Mines yield 1.8x iron. Peak window for Damascus Steel forging.\n\u2022 Horse Year: Workers and caravans move 50% faster, clearing logistics bottlenecks.\n\u2022 Rat Year: Grain output boosts by 1.4x, maximizing granary stores.\n\u2022 Ox Year: Grants natural resilience against Zud frosts and stone boosts.\n\u2022 Sheep Year: Boosts kumis and food by +60%.\n\u2022 Snake Year: Optimal market trade exchange rates.",B.U1,B.O,"12 YIL D\xd6NG\xdcS\xdc",B.a3U,B.a1w,B.Yt,B.Zy,B.a2b,B.a1N)
