B.Tq=new A.bw("bld_castle_detail",B.av,"Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 (Ba\u015fkent Saray\u0131)","Khan's Grand Yurt (Imperial Palace)","\u0130mparatorlu\u011fun kalbi. Seviyesi artt\u0131k\xe7a t\xfcm yap\u0131lara kademeli k\xfcresel \xfcretim bonusu verir.","Heart of the empire. Leveling up grants tiered global multipliers to all structures.","Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131, merkez karoda yer al\u0131r. Seviye 1'den 50'ye kadar kademeli olarak y\xfckseltilebilir. Seviye 5, 15, 30 ve 50 basamaklar\u0131nda mimari g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc evrilir (Deri \xc7ad\u0131rdan Alt\u0131n Kubbeli Saraya). Her seviye k\xfcresel \xfcretimi %1-%6 oran\u0131nda art\u0131r\u0131r.","The imperial palace evolves at levels 5, 15, 30, and 50, providing cumulative production boosts.",B.ju,B.p,"BA\u015eKENT | MERKEZ",B.a4t,B.J,B.J,B.a0Q,B.a1G,B.a24)
