B.Xn=s(["Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Seviye 5 veya \xfczerine y\xfckseltin.","Fethedilmi\u015f bo\u015f bir karoya dokunup \u0130N\u015eA ET men\xfcs\xfcnden SAVUNMA KULES\u0130 se\xe7in.","Kuleleri d\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n y\xfcr\xfcy\xfc\u015f koridorlar\u0131n\u0131 \xe7apraz ate\u015fe alacak \u015fekilde konu\u015fland\u0131r\u0131n.","Kuleyi y\xfckselterek at\u0131\u015f hasar\u0131n\u0131 ve menzil g\xfcc\xfcn\xfc art\u0131r\u0131n."],t.s)
B.a15=s(["Upgrade the Khan Tent to Level 5 or higher.","Tap any owned empty hex and select WATCHTOWER from the build sheet.","Position towers at tactical choke points to create deadly crossfire zones.","Upgrade towers to boost arrow damage and attack cadence."],t.s)
B.Zn=s(["Sur ile kuleyi ayn\u0131 savunma hatt\u0131nda birle\u015ftirin; d\xfc\u015fman suru k\u0131rmaya \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken kule onlar\u0131 yok eder.","Kuleler gece ak\u0131nlar\u0131nda ayd\u0131nlatma me\u015falesi yayarak sava\u015f atmosferini canland\u0131r\u0131r."],t.s)
B.Y8=s(["Combine walls with watchtowers; enemies stopped by walls will be eliminated under heavy arrow fire.","Watchtowers project atmospheric night torches during raids."],t.s)
B.YG=s(["kule","ok\xe7u","savunma","menzil","ok","watchtower","turret","defense"],t.s)
B.Tz=new A.bw("defense_watchtower",B.jr,"G\xf6zc\xfc Savunma Kulesi & Ok\xe7ular","Watchtower & Defense Turrets","Seviye 5 Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 ile a\xe7\u0131lan, 3 Hex menzilli otomatik savunma kulesi. D\xfc\u015fmanlara parabolik 3D voksel oklar f\u0131rlat\u0131r.","Unlocks at Castle Level 5. Automatically fires parabolic 3D voxel arrows at incoming enemies within a 3-hex radius.","Savunma Kulesi, Bozk\u0131r Ak\u0131nlar\u0131na kar\u015f\u0131 en g\xfc\xe7l\xfc aktif savunma yap\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r. 3 Hex menzil i\xe7erisindeki en yak\u0131n d\xfc\u015fman\u0131 otomatik hedefler ve parabolik yayla s\xfcz\xfclen 3D voksel oklar f\u0131rlat\u0131r. Kule seviyesi artt\u0131k\xe7a ok hasar\u0131 katlan\u0131r (15 -> 30 -> 60 -> 120 -> 240+ Hasar) ve Seviye 5+ kuleler alevli manc\u0131n\u0131k g\xfcllesi atarak alan hasar\u0131 (AoE) vurmaya ba\u015flar.","The Watchtower is your main tactical defense structure. It automatically locks onto marching enemies within a 3-hex range and shoots voxel arrows along an arc. Upgrading increases damage significantly, and Level 5+ towers launch fiery catapult boulders with area-of-effect (AoE) blast damage.",B.es,B.Q,"KULE / OK\xc7U (R=3)",B.a5O,B.Xn,B.a15,B.Zn,B.Y8,B.YG)
